P 1|8|32|32768|65536|536870912
R Giant~
S 5 25
S 19 80
S 41 45
S 44 -100
S 28 -10
S 31 80
W shocking grasp~ 200 200
W whirlwind~ 200 200
W storm slash~ 200 200
